+# Forensic Verification Audit Packet: KANBA-43
+
+- Ticket ID: KANBA-43
+- Title: [Phase 1 / Database] Partitioned SHA-256 hash-chained activity_records, append_activity() & verify_activity_chain()
+- Epic: KB-E1
+- Spec References: S1.2, S12.2, S7.2 (8d), S12.3
